    "en": "Persons born under this sign are of middle stature. They posses a lean and muscular body. They are neither stout nor thick. Their complexion will be ruddy and they have a fairly long neck and face. Their head will be broad at the temples and narrow at the chin. They have bushy eye-brows, eyes grey to greyish brown with sharp sight. Their hair will be wiry, color varying from dark to sandy.",
